  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Even complex magic finds a way to feed off of you.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Portentous Training, character level 9th</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you replenish your fate pool, you gain 2 temporary fate points that last for 24 hours. If you pay the entire fate point cost of a use of the portentous magic class feature with temporary fate points sourced from this feat, then you do not discard portent(s) as part of that use of portentous magic.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cartomancy-feats#toc28\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
